		"description": "<p>Drawing your hand across your weapon, you enchant it with vicious clinging shadows. Any successful melee attack before the end of your next turn applies a curse of ongoing Necrotic damage equal to your Charisma modifier for up to 1 minute. Creatures under this curse can remove it by stepping into an area of bright light.</p>",
